          "text": "Moon conjunct Neptune can make you notice somebody else's mood before they tell you what happened. You walk into the room and know something is off, or a song, movie, or memory changes the whole atmosphere inside you. Sensitivity gets confusing when another person's sadness starts feeling like your own, or when the version of someone in your head is easier to love than the person in front of you.",
